@startuml TECH-SEQ-13-Notifications
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 250
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FDEDEC
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #CB4335

title Qualibot-Hub — Séquence Technique : Microservice de Notifications (Decoupled)

participant "Client (React)" as UI
participant "Express API\n(Main Server)" as API
queue "Message Broker\n(Redis Pub/Sub ou RabbitMQ)" as Broker
participant "Notification\nMicroservice" as Micro
participant "Socket.IO\nService" as WSS
database "MongoDB" as DB
participant "Serveur SMTP\n(NodeMailer)" as SMTP

== Déclenchement de l'événement ==
UI -> API : POST /api/v1/actions (Créer une Action)
API -> DB : Save Action (Statut: enAttente)
DB --> API : actionDoc

note over API: L'API principale n'attend pas l'envoi de l'email
API -> Broker : publisher.publish('NOTIFICATION_EVENT', \n{ type: 'ACTION_CREATED', payload: actionDoc, targetUser: id })
API --> UI : HTTP 201 Created (Réponse Rapide)

== Traitement Asynchrone (Microservice) ==
Broker -> Micro : Consomme le message (subscriber)
Micro -> Micro : Parse l'événement (Extract targetUser, HTML Template)

par Envoi Multicanal Asynchrone
    
    == 1. Traçabilité DB ==
    Micro -> DB : Notification.create({\nuser_id, titre: 'Nouvelle Action', lu: false\n})
    
    == 2. Alerte In-App (WebSockets) ==
    Micro -> WSS : emit('PUSH_NOTIF', { targetUser, message })
    WSS -> UI : WebSocket Ping (App met à jour la "Cloche")
    
    == 3. Notification Email ==
    Micro -> DB : User.findById(targetUser).select('email')
    DB --> Micro : email_address
    Micro -> Micro : Compiler HTML (Handlebars / template)
    Micro -> SMTP : sendMail({ to: email, html: "..." })
    SMTP --> Micro : Confirm Sent
    
end

@enduml
